			<img src='http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/f7f0f4ffdb58e6ce6d189d7f0fcb53da?s=32&amp;d=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.gravatar.com%2Favatar%2Fad516503a11cd5ca435acc9bb6523536%3Fs%3D32&amp;r=G' alt='' class='avatar avatar-32 photo' height='32' width='32' />			<cite><a href='http://www.dishtracking.com/blog/' rel='external nofollow' class='url'>Anish K.S</a></cite> Says:
						<br />

			<small class="commentmetadata"><a href="#comment-262" title="">October 27th, 2009 at 09:39</a> </small>

			<p>I Like wordpress than blogger.<br />
<span class="cluv"> Anish K.S´s last blog ..<a href="http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/IndianTelevisionMediaNewsAndUpdates/~3/-ND8JpmtggM/" rel="nofollow">‘Slumdog Crorepati’ On Sunday 25 October 2009 At 1.00 P.M Only on MAX</a> <span class="heart_tip_box"><img src="http://www.teenbloggerkid.com/wp-content/plugins/commentluv/images/littleheart.gif" width="16" class="heart_tip" alt="My ComLuv Profile" border="0" height="14"/></span></span></p>
<p class="thdrpy">[<a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="movecfm(event,262,1,'Anish K.S');">Reply</a>]</p>
		</li>

	
	
		<li id="comment-627">
			<img src='http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/605ba780695a497ebda56032be66b6f9?s=32&amp;d=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.gravatar.com%2Favatar%2Fad516503a11cd5ca435acc9bb6523536%3Fs%3D32&amp;r=G' alt='' class='avatar avatar-32 photo' height='32' width='32' />			<cite><a href='http://www.faydaliweb.com' rel='external nofollow' class='url'>faydaliweb</a></cite> Says:
						<br />

			<small class="commentmetadata"><a href="#comment-627" title="">November 19th, 2009 at 15:19</a> </small>

			<p>Of course wordpress. Because it has lots of plugins so you can create different websites with wordpress.Usage is easy.User firendly interface and much more.Wordpress is the best ı think<br />
<span class="cluv"> faydaliweb´s last blog ..<a href="http://www.faydaliweb.com/galeri/yaratici-flash-tabanli-websiteleri.html" rel="nofollow">Yaratıcı Flash Tabanlı Websiteleri</a> <span class="heart_tip_box"><img src="http://www.teenbloggerkid.com/wp-content/plugins/commentluv/images/littleheart.gif" width="16" class="heart_tip" alt="My ComLuv Profile" border="0" height="14"/></span></span></p>
<p class="thdrpy">[<a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="movecfm(event,627,1,'faydaliweb');">Reply</a>]</p>
		</li>

	
	
		<li class="alt" id="comment-721">
			<img src='http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/748bad99d913686ae44513d8542c9871?s=32&amp;d=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.gravatar.com%2Favatar%2Fad516503a11cd5ca435acc9bb6523536%3Fs%3D32&amp;r=G' alt='' class='avatar avatar-32 photo' height='32' width='32' />			<cite><a href='http://daneblogger.com/' rel='external nofollow' class='url'>Mikkel</a></cite> Says:
						<br />

			<small class="commentmetadata"><a href="#comment-721" title="">November 24th, 2009 at 13:25</a> </small>

			<p>I disagree with WordPress being to advanced.</p>
<p>I takes a half hour to get into the system &#8211; if you need help to set up the blog, you just go to WordPress.tv &#8211; or YouTube..</p>
<p>It&#8217;s clean and clear.</p>
<p class="thdrpy">[<a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="movecfm(event,721,1,'Mikkel');">Reply</a>]</p>
